&lt;p&gt;    Tested and It works well as that remove duplication name. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    But, In my personal opinion, I&apos;d like to suggest that It would be better to show it in its original state. For example, if user who is not permission fail to edit permission, the status of permission is displayed to values before the modification .&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    What do you think?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
